Bundled icon theme for Litterbox, primarily a Breeze subset.

Source: /usr/share/icons/breeze (Debian package breeze-icon-theme), except
mail-archive.svg, an original Litterbox archive-tray glyph under the repository MIT license.
Breeze license: see LICENSE.breeze (Debian copyright format; upstream LGPL-3.0-or-later).

Included named icons (the theme selects the nearest bundled size):
actions: list-add, application-menu, dialog-ok, mail-mark-read-symbolic,
  overflow-menu, document-open, document-preview, document-edit,
  appointment-new, pin, list-remove, mail-receive, view-refresh,
  transform-move, arrow-right, arrow-down,
  go-previous (Breeze), mail-archive (Litterbox archive tray)
places: user-identity, folder
status: system-software-update
